---
import NeighborhoodPage from "../layouts/NeighborhoodPage.astro";
---

<NeighborhoodPage
  title="Dentist Near Oakland Gardens, NY | Thrive Dental"
  description="Dentist near Oakland Gardens, Queens? Thrive Dental is minutes north on Bell Blvd — same-day emergencies, family and cosmetic care, free parking."
  neighborhood="Oakland Gardens"
  distanceNote="a few minutes north on Bell Boulevard"
  blurb="Bell Boulevard connects Oakland Gardens to our office almost in a straight line — a short drive north past Alley Pond Park. We keep same-day emergency openings, see patients on weekends, and cover everything from a child's first exam to implants."
  whyIntro="You can reach us without leaving Bell Boulevard, which is a short enough trip that a dental emergency doesn't turn into a lost day. We hold urgent openings every day the office is open, and we see patients on both weekend days."
  servicesIntro="Routine, cosmetic and restorative care in one place — with three dentists on staff, we can usually match the treatment to the same week you call."
  travelNote="Bell Boulevard runs north from Oakland Gardens straight to our door; Springfield and Francis Lewis Boulevards both connect over to it, and the Horace Harding service road is the fallback in traffic. Buses run the corridor too — the Q27 along Springfield Boulevard, the Q31 up Bell. Parking on site is free."
  landmarks={[
    "Straight north on Bell Blvd, past Alley Pond Park",
    "Springfield Blvd and Francis Lewis Blvd both connect",
    "Q27 and Q31 serve the corridor; free parking on site",
  ]}
  serviceLinks={[
    { href: "/services/emergency-dentistry", label: "Emergency Dentistry" },
    { href: "/services/dental-implants", label: "Dental Implants" },
    { href: "/services/invisalign", label: "Invisalign®" },
    { href: "/services/cosmetic-dentistry", label: "Cosmetic Dentistry" },
    { href: "/services/porcelain-veneers", label: "Porcelain Veneers" },
    { href: "/services/teeth-whitening", label: "Teeth Whitening" },
  ]}
>
  <section slot="after-hero" class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="container-slim max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-gold-700 mb-4">When It Can't Wait</p>
      <h2 class="display-2 mb-5">A short drive when something breaks</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Dental problems rarely announce themselves at a convenient hour. A molar cracks on a bagel, a temporary crown comes off, a filling drops out on a Sunday morning. Because the trip up Bell Boulevard is short, we're a realistic option when you need to be seen today rather than next Thursday — and we deliberately leave openings unbooked each day for exactly that.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        Call (718) 225-6677 and describe what happened. Swelling, a knocked-out tooth and a lost filling are three different levels of urgency, and knowing which one you have changes how quickly we bring you in and what we ask you to do in the meantime. We're open Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday, plus Saturday and Sunday from 9 AM to 3 PM — weekend coverage most practices in this part of Queens don't offer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section slot="before-map" class="bg-sand-50 py-16 border-t border-brand-100/50">
    <div class="container-slim max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="display-2 mb-5">The rest of the year, when nothing is broken</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Most of what we do is quieter than emergencies: cleanings and exams, sealants and fluoride for kids, gum treatment for adults who've been told their pockets are deepening, nightguards for grinders. Cosmetic work runs from whitening and bonding through porcelain veneers, and we're an Invisalign Platinum Provider with iTero scanning, so aligner treatment starts with a digital preview instead of guesswork.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        Between the neighborhood's older co-op blocks and its single-family streets we see a wide age range in a given week, from first checkups to implant-supported dentures. We accept most major PPO plans, check coverage before treatment starts, and will give you a written estimate for anything larger than a filling.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</NeighborhoodPage>
